			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "ZooKeeper is a distributed coordination service that helps manage configuration, naming, and\nsynchronization for distributed applications. It provides a simple file system-like interface but packs\nsophisticated capabilities for managing configuration, service discovery, leader election, and distributed\nlocks.",
			"rawText": "ZooKeeper is a distributed coordination service that helps manage configuration, naming, and synchronization for distributed applications. It provides a simple file system-like interface but packs sophisticated capabilities for managing configuration, service discovery, leader election, and distributed locks.",
