			"updated": 1775169942918,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Sequential ZNodes:  \nThese have an automatically appended monotonically\nincreasing counter to their name. In our chat app, we could\nuse this for ordering messages or implementing distributed\nlocks.",
			"rawText": "Sequential ZNodes:  \nThese have an automatically appended monotonically increasing counter to their name. In our chat app, we could use this for ordering messages or implementing distributed locks.",
