		{
			"id": "Pj4DBiWX",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -406.05637922898177,
			"y": 5036.335750905416,
			"width": 902.4253551821315,
			"height": 60,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bAN",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 2077319018,
			"version": 650,
			"versionNonce": 969433590,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775169942919,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "ZooKeeper isn't designed to run on a single server - that would create a single point of failure. Instead, it runs on\na group of servers called an ensemble. A typical production deployment consists of 3, 5, or 7 servers (odd numbers\nhelp with majority decisions).",
			"rawText": "ZooKeeper isn't designed to run on a single server - that would create a single point of failure. Instead, it runs on a group of servers called an ensemble. A typical production deployment consists of 3, 5, or 7 servers (odd numbers help with majority decisions).",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "ZooKeeper isn't designed to run on a single server - that would create a single point of failure. Instead, it runs on a group of servers called an ensemble. A typical production deployment consists of 3, 5, or 7 servers (odd numbers help with majority decisions).",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "JgQPMpWB",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 585.4471287263697,
			"y": 6498.270369747903,
			"width": 1430.567595821809,
			"height": 100,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bAO",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1510335018,
			"version": 798,
			"versionNonce": 2039788342,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775169942919,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Within this ensemble, servers take on different roles:\n- Leader: One server is elected as the leader and is responsible for processing all update requests. When Server 2 registers a new user connection in ZooKeeper, this write request\ngoes to the leader.\n- Followers: The rest of the servers follow the leader's instructions and help serve read requests. When Server 1 needs to find where Bob is connected, it can read this information\nfrom any ZooKeeper server in the ensemble.",
			"rawText": "Within this ensemble, servers take on different roles:\n- Leader: One server is elected as the leader and is responsible for processing all update requests. When Server 2 registers a new user connection in ZooKeeper, this write request goes to the leader.\n- Followers: The rest of the servers follow the leader's instructions and help serve read requests. When Server 1 needs to find where Bob is connected, it can read this information from any ZooKeeper server in the ensemble.",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Within this ensemble, servers take on different roles:\n- Leader: One server is elected as the leader and is responsible for processing all update requests. When Server 2 registers a new user connection in ZooKeeper, this write request goes to the leader.\n- Followers: The rest of the servers follow the leader's instructions and help serve read requests. When Server 1 needs to find where Bob is connected, it can read this information from any ZooKeeper server in the ensemble.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "a01EyC44",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -497.9582213414956,
			"y": 6737.692649770192,
			"width": 1005.7088971704006,
			"height": 120,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bAP",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1813777642,
			"version": 525,
			"versionNonce": 910482550,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775169942919,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "This distributed design addresses the single point of failure problem we encountered when using a database for user-server\nmapping. If one ZooKeeper server fails, the ensemble continues to function as long as a majority (quorum) of servers are\navailable. For example, with our 3-server ensemble, ZooKeeper can tolerate 1 server failure.\n\nWhen our chat servers connect to ZooKeeper, they connect to all servers in the ensemble:\n",
			"rawText": "This distributed design addresses the single point of failure problem we encountered when using a database for user-server mapping. If one ZooKeeper server fails, the ensemble continues to function as long as a majority (quorum) of servers are available. For example, with our 3-server ensemble, ZooKeeper can tolerate 1 server failure.\n\nWhen our chat servers connect to ZooKeeper, they connect to all servers in the ensemble:\n",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "This distributed design addresses the single point of failure problem we encountered when using a database for user-server mapping. If one ZooKeeper server fails, the ensemble continues to function as long as a majority (quorum) of servers are available. For example, with our 3-server ensemble, ZooKeeper can tolerate 1 server failure.\n\nWhen our chat servers connect to ZooKeeper, they connect to all servers in the ensemble:\n",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "lkjoEoRJ",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -495.6126394334983,
			"y": 6868.150736922351,
			"width": 512.3051917080047,
			"height": 73.6,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bAQ",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 396287914,
			"version": 489,
			"versionNonce": 1436409270,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775169942919,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "// Chat Server 1 connecting to ZooKeeper\nZooKeeper zk = new ZooKeeper(\"zk1:2181,zk2:2181,zk3:2181\", \n                             3000, /* session timeout */ \n                             watcher /* callback */);",
			"rawText": "// Chat Server 1 connecting to ZooKeeper\nZooKeeper zk = new ZooKeeper(\"zk1:2181,zk2:2181,zk3:2181\", \n                             3000, /* session timeout */ \n                             watcher /* callback */);",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 2,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "// Chat Server 1 connecting to ZooKeeper\nZooKeeper zk = new ZooKeeper(\"zk1:2181,zk2:2181,zk3:2181\", \n                             3000, /* session timeout */ \n                             watcher /* callback */);",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.15,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "-C0Ab0QKLedsp9dTS-k4M",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": -507.8521162546349,
			"y": 6850.948545779824,
			"width": 955.4332607014404,
			"height": 113.20926943415907,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
