			"updated": 1775169923344,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Watch notification: \n\"Heads up, Alice just connected to server 1\"",
			"rawText": "Watch notification: \n\"Heads up, Alice just connected to server 1\"",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "rNRYVT3r7R-Yyp9pA686d",
			"originalText": "Watch notification: \n\"Heads up, Alice just connected to server 1\"",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "0tGmcP00",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -527.0198855584281,
			"y": 8574.504934426212,
			"width": 1758.7688974661116,
			"height": 100,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bBy",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1463642026,
			"version": 455,
			"versionNonce": 1206436150,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775169942919,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Without watchers, every time a new message is sent, the server would need to query ZooKeeper to find the recipient's location. This would create significant latency and put enormous pressure on the ZooKeeper cluster. At\nscale, with thousands of messages per second, ZooKeeper would quickly become a bottleneck rather than a solution.\n\nIn our chat application, here's how watches help:\n    1. When Server 1 starts up, it sets a watch on the /chat-app/users directory:",
			"rawText": "Without watchers, every time a new message is sent, the server would need to query ZooKeeper to find the recipient's location. This would create significant latency and put enormous pressure on the ZooKeeper cluster. At scale, with thousands of messages per second, ZooKeeper would quickly become a bottleneck rather than a solution.\n\nIn our chat application, here's how watches help:\n    1. When Server 1 starts up, it sets a watch on the /chat-app/users directory:",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Without watchers, every time a new message is sent, the server would need to query ZooKeeper to find the recipient's location. This would create significant latency and put enormous pressure on the ZooKeeper cluster. At scale, with thousands of messages per second, ZooKeeper would quickly become a bottleneck rather than a solution.\n\nIn our chat application, here's how watches help:\n    1. When Server 1 starts up, it sets a watch on the /chat-app/users directory:",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "nCLyvjih",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -480.2560191335838,
			"y": 8694.134451990178,
			"width": 309.2734375,
			"height": 36.8,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bBz",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 860283498,
			"version": 408,
			"versionNonce": 2061970038,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775169942919,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "// Server 1 watching for user changes\nzk.getChildren(\"/chat-app/users\", true, null);",
			"rawText": "// Server 1 watching for user changes\nzk.getChildren(\"/chat-app/users\", true, null);",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 2,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "// Server 1 watching for user changes\nzk.getChildren(\"/chat-app/users\", true, null);",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.15,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "idM3oeQx",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -509.53564516645974,
			"y": 8760.841032282124,
			"width": 783.0234985351562,
			"height": 20,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bC0",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 768804138,
			"version": 398,
			"versionNonce": 751201206,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775169942919,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "2. When Bob disconnects from Server 2 and reconnects to Server 3, Server 3 updates Bob's ZNode:",
			"rawText": "2. When Bob disconnects from Server 2 and reconnects to Server 3, Server 3 updates Bob's ZNode:",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "2. When Bob disconnects from Server 2 and reconnects to Server 3, Server 3 updates Bob's ZNode:",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "T0iPqphg",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -482.1382052779868,
			"y": 8813.499948007555,
			"width": 417.546875,
			"height": 36.8,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bC1",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 810340330,
			"version": 392,
			"versionNonce": 2074838262,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775169942919,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "// Server 3 updates Bob's location\nzk.setData(\"/chat-app/users/bob\", \"server3\".getBytes(), -1);",
			"rawText": "// Server 3 updates Bob's location\nzk.setData(\"/chat-app/users/bob\", \"server3\".getBytes(), -1);",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 2,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "// Server 3 updates Bob's location\nzk.setData(\"/chat-app/users/bob\", \"server3\".getBytes(), -1);",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.15,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "4AzZLPt3",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -507.4036954584735,
			"y": 8889.5691595767,
			"width": 725.6953125,
			"height": 20,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bC2",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1052721834,
			"version": 478,
			"versionNonce": 2031842870,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775169942919,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "3. ZooKeeper automatically notifies Server 1 about this change through its watcher callback:",
			"rawText": "3. ZooKeeper automatically notifies Server 1 about this change through its watcher callback:",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "3. ZooKeeper automatically notifies Server 1 about this change through its watcher callback:",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "hrSjAZg5",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -488.46150479682365,
			"y": 8941.911403785487,
			"width": 443.140625,
			"height": 202.39999999999998,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bC3",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 601185642,
			"version": 446,
			"versionNonce": 1039875958,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775169942919,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "// Server 1's watcher callback\npublic void process(WatchedEvent event) {\n    if (event.getType() == EventType.NodeDataChanged && \n        event.getPath().equals(\"/chat-app/users/bob\")) {\n        // Get updated server for Bob\n        byte[] data = zk.getData(\"/chat-app/users/bob\", true, null);\n        String bobsServer = new String(data);\n        // Update routing table: Bob is now on Server 3\n        routingTable.put(\"bob\", bobsServer);\n    }\n}",
			"rawText": "// Server 1's watcher callback\npublic void process(WatchedEvent event) {\n    if (event.getType() == EventType.NodeDataChanged && \n        event.getPath().equals(\"/chat-app/users/bob\")) {\n        // Get updated server for Bob\n        byte[] data = zk.getData(\"/chat-app/users/bob\", true, null);\n        String bobsServer = new String(data);\n        // Update routing table: Bob is now on Server 3\n        routingTable.put(\"bob\", bobsServer);\n    }\n}",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 2,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "// Server 1's watcher callback\npublic void process(WatchedEvent event) {\n    if (event.getType() == EventType.NodeDataChanged && \n        event.getPath().equals(\"/chat-app/users/bob\")) {\n        // Get updated server for Bob\n        byte[] data = zk.getData(\"/chat-app/users/bob\", true, null);\n        String bobsServer = new String(data);\n        // Update routing table: Bob is now on Server 3\n        routingTable.put(\"bob\", bobsServer);\n    }\n}",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.15,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
