		{
			"id": "gv6Obcfz",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -519.2955205107519,
			"y": 11513.12604459246,
			"width": 629.8394775390625,
			"height": 80,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bCQ",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1431757994,
			"version": 353,
			"versionNonce": 1415001142,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775169942920,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "When a new video upload service needs to find available transcoders, it simply:\n    - 1. Reads /streaming/services/video-transcoder children\n    - 2. Connects to one of the available transcoder instances\n    - 3. Sets a watch to be notified of any changes to the available transcoders",
			"rawText": "When a new video upload service needs to find available transcoders, it simply:\n    - 1. Reads /streaming/services/video-transcoder children\n    - 2. Connects to one of the available transcoder instances\n    - 3. Sets a watch to be notified of any changes to the available transcoders",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "When a new video upload service needs to find available transcoders, it simply:\n    - 1. Reads /streaming/services/video-transcoder children\n    - 2. Connects to one of the available transcoder instances\n    - 3. Sets a watch to be notified of any changes to the available transcoders",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "kMuCfDEV",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -520.5009655695267,
			"y": 11631.327070108986,
			"width": 2022.1640589956842,
			"height": 40,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bCR",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 187219818,
			"version": 497,
			"versionNonce": 1997487478,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1775169942920,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Many modern systems now use dedicated service discovery tools like Consul or etcd, or rely on platform-provided solutions like Kubernetes Services or AWS Service Discovery. However, the patterns these tools implement are very similar to ZooKeeper's\napproach, and in some cases, they even use ZooKeeper internally.",
			"rawText": "Many modern systems now use dedicated service discovery tools like Consul or etcd, or rely on platform-provided solutions like Kubernetes Services or AWS Service Discovery. However, the patterns these tools implement are very similar to ZooKeeper's approach, and in some cases, they even use ZooKeeper internally.",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Many modern systems now use dedicated service discovery tools like Consul or etcd, or rely on platform-provided solutions like Kubernetes Services or AWS Service Discovery. However, the patterns these tools implement are very similar to ZooKeeper's approach, and in some cases, they even use ZooKeeper internally.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "AyJWPveq",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -522.737383375938,
			"y": 11775.05304104211,
			"width": 299.59979248046875,
			"height": 25,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "hachure",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bCS",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1198604842,
			"version": 349,
